<title>NETHERLANDS: SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUTCH FIRST DIVISION SUMMARY.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Dutch first division soccer match played on Thursday:</p>
<p>NAC Breda 1 (Abdellaoui 20th penalty) NEC Nijmegen 1 (Graef 36th). Halftime 1-1. Attendance 10,760.</p>
